{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_x_029ass_2_1_2_029_22_t01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:20ce99d234f5d1a270abaaa0b6d8b8e8d3b8664ce64e7cba006e407adef4aa8a",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_x_029ass_2_1_2_029_22_t01:1_2_029_22_t01:cmd-000007:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f36cb642472ffec052ee9f2eab4cfc2eced5460dbb3f71425e82172b7501d922",
      "text": "吾主。我如今正追溯着今宵盛宴的记忆。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_029ass_2_1_2_029_22_t01:1_2_029_22_t01:cmd-000009:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c39ae582089dc230e3d13d14d185b7109309fc6167b85ba98b60466f6efd1d7f",
      "text": "散发着不祥魔力的装饰，甜美的圆形贡品，\n以及数不胜数闪烁着璀璨光芒的食粮……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_029ass_2_1_2_029_22_t01:1_2_029_22_t01:cmd-000011:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78990040fad1fd6b2c3a955d761d4bb30d437a23ed0ff92d933f97d4c38d767d",
      "text": "在我诞生于黑暗之中的这片吉日，\n竟能举办如此宏大的筵席……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_029ass_2_1_2_029_22_t01:1_2_029_22_t01:cmd-000013:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf878efd6d107915f95482a23b2a14f6614b22dfd04b0f76f8a9edd7a601998d",
      "text": "咲说吾主也是协力者之一。为颂扬此等功绩，\n我才拿起了这具念话机。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_029ass_2_1_2_029_22_t01:1_2_029_22_t01:cmd-000015:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4351c9a6208833c2fca8372054cf08b0856d63b20e18e2db341fff6430884bc",
      "text": "不用客气！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_029ass_2_1_2_029_22_t01:1_2_029_22_t01:cmd-000016:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8858e71b13c7bc06d9d1bd397fdaa1a1070b9d0a91b23df62678b998c4bd0e03",
      "text": "是个非常美妙的\n派对呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_029ass_2_1_2_029_22_t01:1_2_029_22_t01:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:208e33887f41d0587b57a453b6ebabbcec93ddb8373e562e8bafc718ed54d96d",
      "text": "嗯。当同胞们开始展现出可疑的举动那一刻，\n即便贵为我也曾一度陷入狼狈……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_029ass_2_1_2_029_22_t01:1_2_029_22_t01:cmd-000021:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d56ff6941df538170eda64c67f052846b372eef218a5addf3bbba0990cdbb13",
      "text": "但如今撒旦，以及作为其眷属的我，\n都对那项极秘计划感到无上欢欣。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_029ass_2_1_2_029_22_t01:1_2_029_22_t01:cmd-000023:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:44de4c641a36c59ffae78d62b2b52e69a0c33c6823b1668832825dcc2264b0a9",
      "text": "铭刻于这记忆之中的震撼与喜悦，\n终有一日我定要亲手让同胞们也品尝一番。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_029ass_2_1_2_029_22_t01:1_2_029_22_t01:cmd-000025:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cfc5a353bf71a415c817bf126756c1f21c7f894da42254f7d24725769be5657e",
      "text": "嗯……我心意已决，吾主！待到同胞们诞生之日，\n我将展现我强大的魔术！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_029ass_2_1_2_029_22_t01:1_2_029_22_t01:cmd-000027:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:880553fabe10e6b2a8bf957d93bafc29602622941a1e374f7e2b1045a10f1e73",
      "text": "释放禁断的精制之术，环绕至高贡品，\n举办一场无上盛宴！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_029ass_2_1_2_029_22_t01:1_2_029_22_t01:cmd-000029:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f84d8fc1c4f34026be85c2b8ee222e2f5420b5b32c9ffb7fa0b8c237dab4992d",
      "text": "好的，到时候\n一起庆祝吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_029ass_2_1_2_029_22_t01:1_2_029_22_t01:cmd-000032:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb1d4c29b45054c86a988dca8b79dda15ad10605e98f8672cf515f036daf8c8a",
      "text": "既然心意已决，我必须立即投身于领悟全新精制术之中！再会了，吾主！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
